// Copy to Fork.local.xcconfig (gitignored) to run the Debug build in fork mode: Trade, Cash,
// posting and the take page's receipt go through the fork API instead of the play-money ledger.
//
// Set it to the shared fork on the team's VM (infra/executor), public over HTTPS, so the
// simulator and real iPhones both reach it with nothing else running.
//
// xcconfig treats "//" as a comment, so the URL's slashes are split with $().
//   A fork on this Mac instead (simulator): http:/$()/127.0.0.1:18901
FORK_API_URL = https:/$()/<fork-host>
